# CNC Vacuum Pump Controller — application options

config VAC_SIM
	bool "Simulate the vacuum sensor (no ADC hardware needed)"
	help
	  Feed a synthetic triangle-wave vacuum value into the control loop instead
	  of sampling the ADC, so the display, needle, setpoint bugs, and pump-relay
	  logic can be exercised before the analog sensor is wired.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
